Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:53.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《生化危机：诅咒》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,74年来 苏维埃社会主义强权盛行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 74 years, the might of Soviet socialism was so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,将世界分成东西两半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it split the world along Eastern and Western lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在1991年 它彻底瓦解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, in 1991, it collapsed completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个接着一个 先前支持苏联的各个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one, the various countries which had supported the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也开始分裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}began splitting away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣布独立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}declaring their independence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,东斯拉夫共和国国会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parliament of the Eastern Slav Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,经由诉讼 宣布主权自主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed suit, declaring the country a sovereign state,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从苏联统治中独立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}independent from Soviet rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,资本主义迅速发展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitalism advanced rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业财团在政治圈中产生影响力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The conglomerates gained influence in political circles,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致寡头政治掌权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as a result, the oligarchs came into power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在东斯拉夫共和国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the Eastern Slav Republic,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,贫富差距过大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the divide between rich and poor became so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,点燃一股新的反叛势力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ignited the fuse of a new rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,倡导独立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The push for independence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在街头上演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}exploded into the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装自由斗士与政府对立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed freedom fighters pitted themselves against their government,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今政府由寡头政治家所掌控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now controlled by the oligarchs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时军方强盛起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The military prospered during this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得更加强大 装备更先进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}becoming ever stronger and better equipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伊凡裘丹纳维奇领导之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under the guidance of Ivan Judanovich,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,长老议会的一位酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an Ataman from the Council of Elders,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位自由斗士将基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the freedom fighters moved their base.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迁到隐密之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a hidden location.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个更适合的地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A more suitable place to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,与政府开打游击战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}their guerrilla war against the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过多年无情的争斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After several years of brutal fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯维特拉娜贝利科娃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was Svetlana Belikova,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,东斯拉夫第一位女性总统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eastern Slav's first female president,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,向自由斗士提出停战协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who offered a ceasefire to the freedom fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这份敌意中的和平为期短暂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the break from hostilities was short-lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,2010年11月 政府发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In November of 2010, the government discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.61,0:02:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,反叛军的土地拥有珍贵资源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the rebels' land contained valuable resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,军方持续攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The military continued their attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,声称他们是与恐怖主义交战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}claiming they were fighting terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在军方猛烈攻击下 基地逐一遭到击破{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing one base after another to the military's onslaught,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由斗士们不肯罢休{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the freedom fighters escalated their efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.49,0:02:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在策咯上变得越来越极端{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and became more and more radical in their tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在此时 诡异传闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was then that strange rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如野火般在人民中传播开来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}began spreading like wildfire among the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物已经加入战局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that monsters had joined the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,2011年2月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In February of 2011,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,传闻传到旧城荷利夫葛拉德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rumors made it to the old city of Holifgrad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,距总统府仅几公里之遥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just a few kilometers from the Presidential Palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该城为政府一处重要战略位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an important strategic location for the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,聆听长老之言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to the words of the elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于取得我们所需的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have finally gained the power that we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够带领我们迎向胜利的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power that will lead us to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民 聚集起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚集起来一同战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为独立而战！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight for independence!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！我们遭到猛烈攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retreat! We're getting slaughtered!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.07,0:03:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一名反叛军！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another rebel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要拒捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not resist arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撒退！- 放下武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Retreat! - Drop your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上投降 - 政府走狗！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Surrender immediately. - Government pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,重覆 不要拒捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, do not resist arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上投降{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrender immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往定位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}COPY…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从空中能够清楚看到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a clear view of you from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以帮我找出中情局的分配路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can help me find a clear route to the CIA drop-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他们在下面这里做了些重大翻修{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they're doing some serious renovations down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细听我说 里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me carefully, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务中止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission has been aborted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,美方将撤离这个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The U. S. is going to pull out of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我才刚到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我从休假中抓来 派我到这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After taking me off furlough and sending me to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴森的鬼地方之后？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}godforsaken place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿与本地政府决定分道扬镳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington and the government there have decided to go their separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是外交人员 所有人都必需离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has to leave, not just embassy staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有美国公民听令撒离这个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All American citizens have been ordered to evacuate the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管什么政治纷争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a damn about the politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经证实生化武器被用在这场战争之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got confirmation that B.O.W.s are being used in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果现在不阻止他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't stop them now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各地将会发生相同惨剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same shit will happen everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你希望见到的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really wanna see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战争 情况不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a war and things are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺乏美国政府的支持 没有人能够擅自行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can do anything without backup from the American government.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你也不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我想我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, I guess my only option is to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能暂时先失去美国公民身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lose my American citizenship for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以跟他们说我迷路 没搭上飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can tell them I got lost and missed my flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好快点完成任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better hurry up and get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吃早餮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,稻草人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scarecrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是锡铁人 你能说话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Tin Man. Can you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,反政府势力与生化武器之间有什么关联？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the connection between the anti-government forces and the B.O.W.s?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜稻草人的长处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess scarecrows aren't known.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是与人沟通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for rousing conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救你出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bee…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,养蜂人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beekeeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在外面看到的蜜蜂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The honeybee I saw outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真倒楣 现在我得面对一只胆小的狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Now I got a cowardly lion to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜查楼下的房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the room down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey… Unh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一间呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.29,0:10:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这间没人 - 继续行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This one's clear. - We're moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好再留久一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better stay here a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有可能会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们的人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think our hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be of any use?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们是谁吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是桃乐丝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Dorothy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中情局的人称我们为恐怖份子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people in the CIA call us terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们比较喜欢自称为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we prefer to call ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,独立派斗士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pro-independence fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局的人在这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the CIA doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.23,0:11:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你要政府这么做的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you put the government up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还有其他人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any more of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是中情局探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a CIA agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是一个休假休到一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just an American who was screwed out of his vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,被丢上飞机 带到这里来的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dumped on a plane and brought here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还没吃早餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在你度假度到一半时找你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came for you while you were on vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.25,0:12:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是中情局高层 他们才会这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got to be high up in the CIA for them to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你电影看太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You watch too many movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道一般美国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it common for people in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,度假时会带这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be packing one of these while on vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然会 我们从开国起就这样干了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. We've been doing it since the country was founded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 美国真是超炫的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, America's the bomb, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你不是中情局的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even if you're not CIA,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 你肯定有独到之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no doubt you must be pretty special.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国才会派你过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for America to send you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,总归你能对抗那玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were able to take on that thing, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再不停止乱搞那玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't stop messing around with that thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把我们全都害死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna get us all killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 你是我们的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no doubt about the fact that you are our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场反恐怖份子扫荡行动执行中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An anti-terrorist sweep is now in operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众请尽量…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilians should avoid…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…避免外出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…going outside as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果见到可疑人物或可疑行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see any suspicious people or behavior,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,请立刻通报有关当局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}report it to the authorities immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况汇报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Status.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人逃到地下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some escaped underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是逮捕他们是迟早的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's only a matter of time before they are rounded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说详细一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me in more detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么时候？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样子的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.57,0:13:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的错误你还要犯多少次？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times are you going to make the same mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早在五年前就该成为联合国一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have become a member of the United Nations five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,至今成为欧盟国际社会中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by now be a respected member.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,备受尊敬的成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the international community in our role as an EU nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在这件事成真之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before that could happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一群人从下水道爬出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}another group came crawling out of the sewers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大喊分离宣言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}screaming their declarations of separatism.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这种事之所以会发生的主要原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the main cause of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为你纵容恐怖份子为所欲为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because you allowed the terrorists to do as they please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不快点行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't act soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将永远失去真正独立的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will lose our chance for true independence forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让这种事发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we cannot allow that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不计一切代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的访客到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your visitor has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到东斯拉夫 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Eastern Slav, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斯维特拉娜贝利科娃总统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am President Svetlana Belikova.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 请容我向你们介绍我们的贵宾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, allow me to introduce you to our guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位年轻女士是特别调查员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This young lady is a special investigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自于联合国生化恐怖主义安全评估联盟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the United Nations' Bio-terrorism Security Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,日安 总统阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, Madam President.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化恐怖主义安全评估联盟派我来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been sent here by the BSAA.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.53,0:15:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是艾达王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Ada Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.11,0:15:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不叫喂 你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is not, "Hey, you."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是JD{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm JD.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这不是我的真名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although that's not my real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老头看起来不太妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man's not looking too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都是那张脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always looks like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你说的没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 你到底来这个国家做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, what are you really doing in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个问题问好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, a different question for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. What I mean is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国比在这里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}being in America is a lot more fun than…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩多了 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}being here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hamburgers, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸鸡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fried chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你国家的食物太好吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food in your country's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.75,0:15:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我每天吃都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could eat it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你宝贵的意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the valuable insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有好莱坞电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Hollywood movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超爱那玩意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有50张DVD{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have 50 DVDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一张是盗版{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them are pirated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.83,0:16:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们讨厌美国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you guys hated America.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当然讨厌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, we hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是美国制产品？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But things made in America?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可就是两回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:26.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你想怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别按那个按钮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't push that button.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会上当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not falling for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会允许他们追踪这通电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way I'll allow them to trace the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面情况怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are things out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来城里旧区都被包围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they have the old pan of the city surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好等着看情况如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better wait and see how things pan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.47,0:16:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物有机化学武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bio Organic Weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,简称{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also known as.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}B.O.W.s.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:17:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数已开发国家与联合国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most developed countries and the United Nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,反对使用并生产生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are against the use and manufacture of B.O.W.s.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是很不幸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, they are, unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍在世界各地的黑市交易流通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}still traded on the world's black markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迅速看了一下这份报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a quick glance at this report,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在激烈冲突中使用这些武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that using these weapons in a real conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常不切实际 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be extremely impractical, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是敌是友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way to differentiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以区分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between friend and foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.07,0:17:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 想彻底掌控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true that total control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of most of the B.O.W.s.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,近乎不可能 直到现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been nearly impossible up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近研发出一项{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a new technology that changes that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变这个现象的新技术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has recently been developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,近来先进技术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recent technological advancements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可建立出人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}can establish a master/slave relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,与生化武器之间的主仆关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between a human and the B.O.W.s.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢？他们怎么做 甩它鞭子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? What do they do, crack whips at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,像训练野生动物那样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like they do with wild animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不尽然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机体 设计用来决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organisms, designed to determine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,宿主为管理者还是受控者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether a host is to be a controller or a controlee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,占据宿主的身体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}take up residence within the host's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造出介于人类与生化武器之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and creates the perfect master/slave relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的主仆关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between a human and the B.O.W.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,与女王蜂与工蜂的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Similar to the relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很相似{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a queen bee shares with her worker bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 能不能跟你谈一谈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, bro. Can I speak to you for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.45,0:18:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Ataman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在移动他可能有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be dangerous to move him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的美国朋友对他也很有兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your American friend has also taken quite an interest in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能永远留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在里面？开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's in there? Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人吗？- 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anyone there? - Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开！- 不要抵抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open up! - Stop resisting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点出来 - 后退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and come out. - Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动 手举高 不要动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. Hands in the air. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留在原地 - 不要开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay still. - Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 带他们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep away…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,远一点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.89,0:19:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's turned!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在楼下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone is in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot. Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ataman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们马上就要到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 本来一切都很顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, just when things were going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以赢得这场战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can win this war,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候… 到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.78,0:21:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会在天堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll be rooting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 你这个笨蛋 你以为你穿的防弹衣是女生衬衫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Get up, you idiot. You think that vest you're wearing is a girl's blouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把酋长带离这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get Ataman away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该猜到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个美国人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the American?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概死了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:21:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再继续这样下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go on like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll all be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.19,0:22:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提要发动什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we can launch an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,首都攻击计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.23,0:22:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造一个新的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Create a new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.39,0:23:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 我听见枪声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way. I heard gunshots.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看马可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go and check on Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去教堂找其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You head to the church and join the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.81,0:25:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得我会上当？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think I'm gonna fall for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.19,0:25:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了你 - 我看起来像需要修剪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill you. - Do I look like I need a pruning?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.43,0:25:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.16,0:25:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能同意这个要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one request I can't grant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.30,0:25:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱考夫先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chenkov.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.70,0:25:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.91,0:25:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是我的老师 - 不是他死 就是我亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was my teacher. - It was him or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.91,0:25:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.38,0:25:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经不再是你的老师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wasn't your teacher anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.57,0:26:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.74,0:26:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 JD{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot, JD!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.92,0:27:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该死的不开枪 带枪干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell carry that gun around if you're not gonna use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.60,0:27:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.96,0:27:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我会开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll use it next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.95,0:27:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你决定开枪打那些东西 麻烦你瞄准头部 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever decide to shoot those things, shoot them in the head, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.96,0:27:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.25,0:28:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个大男人应该打得开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two grown men should be able to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.86,0:28:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是什么地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.46,0:28:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去老游击队员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old partisans used to hole up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.66,0:28:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,都躲在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.96,0:28:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真懂得怎么隔离敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sure knew how to keep the enemy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.70,0:28:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意不动如山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing ain't gonna budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.47,0:28:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.98,0:28:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.39,0:28:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.91,0:29:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.59,0:29:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道我不该…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I knew I should have…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.59,0:29:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续吃那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stayed off the.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.06,0:29:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}junk food.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.27,0:29:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry LIP.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.97,0:30:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.24,0:30:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住他 - 离我远一点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him. - Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.01,0:30:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.15,0:30:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.52,0:31:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要！- 抓住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No! - Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.66,0:31:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.86,0:31:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, somebody help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.26,0:31:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.20,0:31:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.37,0:31:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.94,0:31:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.64,0:32:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家是怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.27,0:32:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有躲藏的地方吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere we can hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.66,0:33:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把所有人怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.76,0:33:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们藏的寄生体跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Plaga you were hiding got loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.06,0:33:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.17,0:33:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们宝贵的市民被寄生虫所控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your precious townsfolk are being controlled by a parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.40,0:33:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,会经由脊堆神经附着到中枢神经系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It attaches itself to the central nervous system via the spinal cord.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说镇上的人都…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people of the town are…?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.18,0:33:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们永远不可能回复正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never be normal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.88,0:33:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 定有办法的 - 扯掉脊堆神经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There must be something we can do. - Rip out the spinal cord,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.35,0:33:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最好的结果只有瘫痪或死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the best you could hope for is paralysis or death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.52,0:33:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.72,0:33:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真是这样想 你为什么要杀掉那个老人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really believe that, then why did you kill the old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.56,0:33:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.03,0:33:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你知道他永远不可能回复成人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you knew he would never be human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.80,0:33:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he says is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.70,0:34:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有其他问题要问你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some more questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.68,0:34:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这一次 我们能够找到真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this time we can get to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.94,0:34:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.58,0:34:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得去拿 - 去拿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to go and get it. - Go and get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.48,0:34:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.71,0:34:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要有人取代酋长的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need somebody to take over for Ataman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.45,0:34:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也见到外面发生的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen what's happening outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.55,0:34:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让这种事发生在你身上吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want that to happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.13,0:35:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今日的所作所为会是国家明日的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we do today will carry the country into tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.76,0:35:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算如此…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天会跟其他人碰面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet up with the others tomorrow to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.94,0:35:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划攻击总统府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an attack on the Presidential Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.91,0:35:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好万全准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.25,0:35:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.05,0:35:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他说句话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a word with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.73,0:36:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他去拿了 - 拿寄生体？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gone to get it. - The Plaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.99,0:36:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道它叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.73,0:36:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道是长老给我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that it was given to us by the elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.38,0:36:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们注射到身体里 好控制利卡？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You inject that stuff into your body to control the Lickers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.05,0:36:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有同情心的长老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some compassionate elders you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.35,0:36:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What other options do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.32,0:36:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道整个世界都无视于我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you realize that the whole world ignores us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.96,0:36:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就快要灭绝了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we are in danger of extermination?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.99,0:36:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.39,0:36:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这件事上 我们的意见永远不会一致{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna see eye to eye on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.56,0:36:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.07,0:36:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想看到他变成怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see him change into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.97,0:36:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳娜会很难过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irina would not be happy about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.04,0:36:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irina?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.91,0:37:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从小就认识她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew her since we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.38,0:37:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪的未婚妻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy's fiancée.\n.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.28,0:37:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是学校老师 信不信由你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a school teacher and, believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.22,0:37:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so was Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.06,0:37:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些混蛋以为他们的学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastards thought their school.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.03,0:37:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是独立派的藏匿处 并且进行攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a pro-independence hideout and attacked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.03,0:37:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳娜跟孩子们死于攻击之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irina and the kids died in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.02,0:37:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他才来打这场仗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the reason why he's fighting this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.29,0:37:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这之前 他从来没拿过枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had never even held a gun up until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.99,0:38:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会假装你逃跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to pretend you escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.19,0:38:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为回报 你一定要抢在他之前拿到手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return, you must get ahold of it before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.49,0:38:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在相信我了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.66,0:38:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁 或是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who or what you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.43,0:38:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我知道你救了我一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I do know that you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.47,0:38:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必需阻止沙夏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must stop Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.01,0:38:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在中央市场找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find him in the central marketplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.80,0:39:22.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（市场）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.42,0:39:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人注意 马上疏散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.06,0:39:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上八点正式展开任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The operation begins at 2000 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.93,0:39:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人注意 马上疏散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.48,0:40:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.55,0:40:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.80,0:40:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见 里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.23,0:40:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.97,0:40:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正准备问你同样的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.61,0:40:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你释出寄生体？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you release the Plaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.58,0:40:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逗我笑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.35,0:40:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对瑕疵品没兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested in defective products.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.02,0:40:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮他们一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just here to lend them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.62,0:40:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.35,0:41:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他们看起来并不需要我帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although it seems as if my help wasn't needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.36,0:41:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.73,0:41:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们攻击首都{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they attack the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.36,0:41:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务就轻松多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll make my job a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.73,0:41:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.00,0:41:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.30,0:41:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们何时再继续…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when are we going to, um, carry on…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.74,0:41:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一晚未完之事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from where we left off that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.01,0:41:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不是现在 随时候教{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time but now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.84,0:41:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在生我的气 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angry with me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.95,0:41:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很符合你的个性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.05,0:41:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,简短警告你一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick word of warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.56,0:41:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座城镇很快说要被肃清了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This town will be purged soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.15,0:42:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.88,0:42:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.65,0:42:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好后 随时可以展开攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may start the attack when you are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.72,0:42:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.83,0:42:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,带艾达王来见我 该给她看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring Ada Wong to me. She should see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.63,0:42:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我得扮圣诞老人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I get to play Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.09,0:43:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.66,0:43:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 只是稍微降低了点戒心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just let my guard down for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.03,0:44:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把我们横扫一空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got us pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.48,0:44:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴迪呢？- 我到时他已经离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Buddy? - He already left by the time I got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.65,0:44:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 我们得赶紧离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn! - We have to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.99,0:44:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,军方会将这整区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The military's gonna burn the whole area.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.45,0:44:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟里面所有东西烧毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everything in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.12,0:44:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.96,0:44:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.37,0:44:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.24,0:44:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我非做不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.23,0:45:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you be needing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.11,0:45:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you my man. Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.19,0:45:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.02,0:45:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了 你还是人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. You're still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.00,0:45:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.40,0:45:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他不是我们的敌人 他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's not our enemy. He's…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.10,0:45:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.14,0:45:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to cause any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.08,0:45:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,该是说再见的时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.30,0:46:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.68,0:46:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不在乎国家独不独立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I didn't really care about independence.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.32,0:46:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想跟你 还有我的朋友过得愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanted was to have fun with you and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.56,0:46:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.22,0:47:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本很期待能带你参观美国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking forward to showing you America.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.83,0:47:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.10,0:47:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事每次都会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen this happen every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.48,0:47:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你面对的是生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're dealing with B.O.W.s,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.48,0:47:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是敌是友 毫无分别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no difference between friend or enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.55,0:47:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会夺走你的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes everything from you:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.85,0:47:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你战斗的目的 对他人的尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cause you're fighting for, the respect you have for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.69,0:47:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必需阻止这种事再次发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to keep this from ever happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.50,0:47:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把寄生体给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the Plaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.40,0:47:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我个人认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I am concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.04,0:48:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟使用生化武器没什么两样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no difference between this and using B.O.W.s.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.92,0:48:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要阻止这种事继续发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to keep this from happening again,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.92,0:48:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}put down your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.16,0:48:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.40,0:48:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的答案…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my answer…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.43,0:48:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你的答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.09,0:48:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁生化武器正依计划进行中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The eradication of the B.O.W.s is moving ahead according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.93,0:49:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能让他们逃离这座城市 半个都不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mustn't allow even one of them to escape the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.80,0:49:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已做好万全准备与应变措施 阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are prepared for all eventualities, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.47,0:49:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件关于艾达王的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one more thing, regarding Ada Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.94,0:49:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现什么消息吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything out?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.14,0:49:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化恐怖主义安全评估联盟没有名叫艾达王的员工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no one working for the BSAA by the name of Ada Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.85,0:49:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.35,0:49:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.42,0:49:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.67,0:49:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央大门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.04,0:49:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,回报状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report your status.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.38,0:49:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央大门回报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central gate reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.01,0:49:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切平静 - 收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All is calm. - Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.88,0:49:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁大眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.52,0:49:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,三辆卡车接近中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three trucks are approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.32,0:49:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.83,0:50:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.37,0:50:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.54,0:50:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚去哪了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you go last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.58,0:50:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在饭店里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were not in the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.52,0:50:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to meet an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.52,0:51:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位老朋友…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this old friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.25,0:51:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是间谍吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is he a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.13,0:51:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为谁工作 俄罗斯人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you working for? The Russians?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.53,0:51:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.47,0:51:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个就留给你想像了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave that to your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.20,0:51:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到你永远无法离开这个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering that you will never be leaving this country again,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.07,0:51:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你最好站在我这一方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say it is in your best interests to stay on my good side.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.15,0:51:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.50,0:52:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你以前当过教练 原来是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's true what they said about you being a former instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.48,0:52:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前？我现在还是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Former? I still am an instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.89,0:53:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.16,0:53:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖份子闯过中央大门了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The terrorists broke through the central gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.07,0:53:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我先前所说 我们决定延后你离开的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I said, we have decided to delay your departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.11,0:53:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,无限期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.06,0:53:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人佩服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.59,0:54:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.79,0:54:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西不适合当宠物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}these things make bad pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.33,0:54:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭到恐怖份子攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are under attack by terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.32,0:54:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要支援！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need reinforcements, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.67,0:54:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统府快要守不住了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't defend the palace much longer. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.95,0:56:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但我没时间留下来聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sony, but I don't have time to stay and chat right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.63,0:57:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,业余人士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.13,0:57:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们连搜身都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't even give me a pat-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.36,0:57:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到这么轻易就能进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect to get into this place so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.51,0:58:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为一个旧核子庇护所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty impressive for.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.01,0:58:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里算很厉害了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an old nuclear shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.42,0:58:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you missed me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.79,0:58:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 你想得美咧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. In your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.60,0:58:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seeing what I'm seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.50,0:59:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就像蜂巢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a beehive.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.25,0:59:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有查看这些里面吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you looked inside one of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.95,0:59:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是寄生体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Plaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.26,0:59:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人惊讶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.20,0:59:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去培育的是工蜂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Workers have been cultivated in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.57,0:59:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.34,0:59:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第一次培育出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the first time that the dominant members.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.61,0:59:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个种类的上位成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the species have been cultured.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.74,0:59:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.45,0:59:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在工作 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.48,0:59:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可担心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.78,0:59:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.89,1:00:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是为了这个而来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is what you're here for.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.23,1:00:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.50,1:00:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,满意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.77,1:00:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,满意 多谢你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.97,1:00:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.61,1:00:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.11,1:00:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是美国探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an American agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.64,1:00:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个疑问解决了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that we got that out of the way…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.31,1:00:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An American?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.52,1:00:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better watch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.15,1:00:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老太婆是会咬人的狗不会叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That old broad's got a bite worse than her bark.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.75,1:00:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.79,1:00:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里！在那里！开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there! Over there! Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.13,1:00:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火！停火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ceasefire! Ceasefire! Unh!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.00,1:00:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ceasefire!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.32,1:01:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.46,1:01:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底知不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.83,1:01:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的枪是指着谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who you are pointing your gun at?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.74,1:01:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Yeah, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.30,1:01:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是养蜂人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the beekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.01,1:01:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,养蜂人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beekeeper?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.74,1:01:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,释出寄生体的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person who released the Plaga.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.45,1:01:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所想的一样 你半点头绪都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I thought, you haven't a clue.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.65,1:01:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这个国家的总统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the president of this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.54,1:01:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来艾达是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what Ada meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.17,1:01:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是国家的敌人 杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is an enemy of the state. Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.56,1:02:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物冲破货物出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creatures broke through.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.26,1:02:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们往你们那里去了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cargo entrance! They're heading your way!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.76,1:02:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.77,1:03:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火 停火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease fire. Cease fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.08,1:03:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.65,1:03:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.34,1:04:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you use it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.98,1:04:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.72,1:04:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.52,1:05:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我阻止不了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.50,1:05:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.14,1:05:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.96,1:06:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我 对你有什么好处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you gain by killing me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.89,1:06:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有仔细想过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you thought this through?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.96,1:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个国家一旦独立 将由谁领导？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will lead the country once you gain independence?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.67,1:06:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.17,1:06:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意听取{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no intention of taking advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.20,1:06:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个谋朝窜位的人的意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a pretender to the throne. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.87,1:06:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you're interested,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.84,1:07:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有长老 除了酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of the elders, with the exception of Ataman,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.31,1:07:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已经站到我这一方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have already come over to my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.55,1:07:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向他们保证将分原油利润给他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all said they would be happy to renege on independence.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.39,1:07:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都说很乐意放弃独立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}once I promised to share the oil profits with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.39,1:07:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.56,1:07:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本也是这样以为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.90,1:07:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很遗憾 是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm afraid it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.37,1:07:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Unh!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.94,1:07:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里浪费时间的当下 世界各地出现变化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While we have been wasting time here, things have been happening in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.88,1:07:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time to fight amongst ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.92,1:07:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个小国里内斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this tiny little country.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.55,1:07:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.21,1:08:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好极了 一波未平一波又起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. It just keeps getting better.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.37,1:08:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必需离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.87,1:08:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯维特拉娜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Svetlana!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.68,1:08:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦测到生化危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A biohazard release has been detected.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.12,1:08:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,疏散 疏散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate. Evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.99,1:08:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,本基地即将焚毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The incineration of the facility will begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.88,1:10:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.05,1:11:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it doing that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.16,1:11:03.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（解除）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.20,1:11:03.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（完成）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.56,1:11:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.71,1:11:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要帮我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you helping me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.11,1:11:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别感激我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get all sentimental on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.28,1:12:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.52,1:12:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没有其他人可以告诉世界真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody else left to tell the world what really happened, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.13,1:12:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,舱口！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hatch!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.05,1:12:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以从这里上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will take us up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.26,1:12:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.69,1:12:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.90,1:12:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.19,1:13:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.31,1:13:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是东斯拉夫共和国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an announcement.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.31,1:13:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府通告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the government of the Eastern Slav Republic.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.18,1:13:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are under attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.91,1:13:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖份子攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.08,1:13:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能使用了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biochemical weapons…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.72,1:13:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}may have been used.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.25,1:13:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请立即疏散全城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ordered to evacuate the city immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.76,1:13:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,请远离首都五公里远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep a distance of five kilometers from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.96,1:13:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.43,1:14:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.83,1:14:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,军方已经撤离本城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forces have been evacuated from the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.24,1:14:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱恐怖份子释出的生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to escape the B.O.W.s released by the terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.97,1:14:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.21,1:14:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,庇护所里的两人似乎逃脱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it appears the two in the shelter have managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.71,1:14:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要浪费时间告诉我这件事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you wasting my time telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.81,1:14:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让你知道的那个「东西」 除掉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let the you-know-what get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.92,1:14:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上去办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see to it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.43,1:14:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.32,1:17:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.65,1:18:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开那里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.19,1:18:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不该这样做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.02,1:20:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,非要斗就是了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to fight this out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.97,1:20:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉插一下手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sony for butting in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.19,1:21:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑得了一时 跑不了一世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can run, but you can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.69,1:21:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 别害羞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, come on. Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.88,1:21:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}NOW!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.08,1:21:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有点痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might hurt a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.09,1:22:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.82,1:22:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被生化武器所救{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by B.O.W.s.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.08,1:22:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去喝两杯吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna go grab a few beers?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.51,1:22:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你请客？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you buying?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.48,1:22:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我 你走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to go without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.33,1:22:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找不到其他人玩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't they find anybody else to play with?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.84,1:23:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你走吧 别管我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go without me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.84,1:23:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢有人陪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.05,1:23:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们动作最好快一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better move a little faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.52,1:23:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,今日 首都{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today the capital.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.79,1:23:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭到恐怖份子发起的猛烈攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was subjected to a powerful attack launched by terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.56,1:23:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以骇人听闻的大规模武器出击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They struck with fearsome weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.30,1:23:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是国际间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of mass destruction known as B. O.W.s,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.14,1:23:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所禁止的生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which have been banned internationally.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.84,1:23:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们国家别无所求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We as a country desire nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.31,1:23:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只求和平生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to live in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.65,1:23:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,与反政府运动的长老们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together with the elders of the anti-government movement,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.35,1:23:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,仁慈地聆听我们的请求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, might I add, graciously listened to our pleas,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.36,1:23:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,设法避开我国史上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have managed to avert the most serious crisis.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.49,1:23:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重大的危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the history of our nation.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.16,1:24:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这毫无疑问证明了身为一个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe this is undeniable proof that as a country,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.23,1:24:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为人民的我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a people,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.83,1:24:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有资格受到全面支持 进入国际社会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are suitable for full acceptance into the international community.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.61,1:24:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为领导人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As leader…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.61,1:24:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.51,1:24:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.35,1:24:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就即兴演讲吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll improvise.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.36,1:24:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,长老们呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the elders?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.59,1:24:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 所有人 就在不久之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over. All of them. A little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.96,1:24:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我该在记者会上提到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I should mention that during the press conference,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.83,1:24:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖份子将长老视为叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the terrorists executed the elders.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.97,1:24:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,处以死刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as traitors.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.64,1:24:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.21,1:24:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.41,1:24:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我联络生化恐怖主义安全评估联盟与国际刑警组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already contacted the BSAA and Interpol.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.25,1:24:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,告知艾达王造成我们多大的损失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with regard to the damage we sustained because of Ada Wong.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.65,1:24:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际间很快就会通缉她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An international warrant for her arrest will be issued soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.66,1:25:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,几位恐怖份子成功脱离城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few of the terrorists managed to escape the city,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.72,1:25:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过不用担心他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't have to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.06,1:25:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外两个人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the other two?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.50,1:25:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是时间上的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.27,1:25:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于没人能够阻止我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, there is no one left to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.00,1:25:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 总统阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, Madam President.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.47,1:25:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 马上召开记者会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, let's start the press conference immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.57,1:25:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 总统阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course, Madam President.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.02,1:25:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.75,1:25:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的明天即将展开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a new tomorrow begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.71,1:27:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全程都在监看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were keeping an eye on me the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.28,1:27:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将播出 五 四 三…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On air in five, four, three…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.76,1:27:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 我是总统…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. I am President…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.92,1:27:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.19,1:27:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭到美国人与俄罗斯人攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under attack by the Americans and Russians.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.63,1:27:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.33,1:27:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下 狗东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down, you dogs.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.66,1:27:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.40,1:27:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 带走他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move. Keep them away.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.27,1:27:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.47,1:28:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 手举高！- 救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hands in the air! - Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.12,1:28:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.96,1:28:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人与俄罗斯人从一开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans and Russians had us in the palms of their hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.46,1:28:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就紧紧掌握住我们的动态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.36,1:28:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎是如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.13,1:28:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先前知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.47,1:28:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.01,1:28:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我知道 我就继续度假了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I did, I'd still be enjoying my vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.58,1:28:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He?!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.54,1:29:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.71,1:29:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的导师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mentor,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.68,1:29:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.76,1:29:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也没有奋斗下去的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing left to fight for.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.87,1:29:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.84,1:29:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.77,1:29:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想变成那些怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to change into one of those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.60,1:30:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.26,1:30:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess there is no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.25,1:30:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你 我也会有相同感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd feel the same way if I was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.39,1:30:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是自杀已经不在选项之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the option of taking our own lives no longer belongs to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.43,1:30:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我们开始使用这个 就欠了那些死在我们身边的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we start using these, we owe it to the people who died alongside us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.90,1:30:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必需继续活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to continue living.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.78,1:31:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算四肢瘫痪也在所不辞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it means living the rest of our lives without the use of our limbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.13,1:31:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.73,1:31:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你的回答…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your answer…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.67,1:31:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.11,1:31:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,使东斯拉夫共和国支离破碎的内战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been three days since the end of the civil war.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.18,1:31:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束三天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that tore through the Eastern Slav Republic.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.75,1:31:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏美国与俄罗斯军队介入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fierce battles.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.35,1:31:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,才得以中止激烈战役{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}were halted thanks to the intervention of American and Russian troops.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.83,1:31:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是第一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today marks the first day.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.56,1:31:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各国媒体得以进入该城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which the world's media has access to the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.56,1:31:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,由美国与俄罗斯领导的临时政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A temporary government headed by the U. S. and Russia.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.77,1:31:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,将设立在东斯拉夫共和国维持和平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be set up in the Eastern Slav Republic to maintain peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.80,1:31:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯维特拉娜贝利科娃辞去总统一职{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Svetlana Belikova has resigned from her presidency.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.34,1:32:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持她的财团与前政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and companies that supported her and the former government.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.84,1:32:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,将被驱离该国并且解散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be thrown out of the country and dismantled.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.92,1:32:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上层从一开始说知情 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top brass knew about it right from the beginning, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.66,1:32:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,稻草人的报告警告他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The report from Scarecrow tipped them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.09,1:32:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯维特拉娜持有生化武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Svetlana was in possession of B.O.W.s.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.36,1:32:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们才仓皇撒离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they pulled out in a panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.33,1:32:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,仓促逃命 然后与俄罗斯人联手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ran like hell to join forces with the Russians.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.33,1:32:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了保护自己 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect themselves, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.34,1:32:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.87,1:32:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统与此事无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The president had nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.54,1:32:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我们都不知道怎么回事 你一定要相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even we knew what was going on. You have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.45,1:32:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.95,1:32:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我哪都不去 - 不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not going anywhere - Don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.12,1:32:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终 什么都没改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, nothing's really changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.11,1:33:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切皆按计划进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything went according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.55,1:33:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地已摧毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The facility has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.72,1:33:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抢救出培育出来的寄生体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I salvaged the cultivated Plaga.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.46,1:33:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还没决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I haven't decided.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.36,1:33:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要把这东西寄给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether or not I should send it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.30,1:33:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.80,1:33:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你人真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. That's very kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.40,1:33:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我还蛮想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, I sort of liked the idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.14,1:33:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在个人资料上添上一笔国际通缉犯的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of adding an international arrest warrant to my profile.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.28,1:34:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.99,1:34:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会惹上麻烦的 - 你有做吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're going to get in trouble. - Did you do yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.53,1:34:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.16,1:34:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.45,1:34:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点走吧 我们要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, let's go, we're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.02,1:34:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
